    "notes": [
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for transfig",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for transfig fixes the following issues:\n\nUpdate to fig2dev version 3.2.9a\n\n- CVE-2025-46397: Fixed a stack buffer overflow in fig2dev in bezier_spline function (bsc#1243260).\n- CVE-2025-46398: Fixed a stack buffer overflow in fig2dev in read_objects function (bsc#1243262).\n- CVE-2025-46399: Fixed a segmentation fault in fig2dev in genge_itp_spline function (bsc#1243263).\n- CVE-2025-46400: Fixed a segmentation fault in fig2dev in read_arcobject function (bsc#1243261).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
      {
